ion": "\nQtum October Community &amp; Development Update\n\nNew projects building on Qtum, new heavily growing communities as well as staking results and more! \n\nRead more here;\nhttps://blog.qtum.org/october-community-development-update-7bf4d56bad68", "category": "general", "created_at": "2022-11-03T16:41:57.406Z", "user": null, "user_title": "Marketing Director", "pin": false, "project": {"type": "Coin", "id": "qtum", "name": "Qtum", "symbol": "qtum", "image": {"thumb": "https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/684/thumb/Qtum_Logo_blue_CG.png?1696501874", "small": "https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/684/small/Qtum_Logo_blue_CG.png?1696501874", "large": "https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/684/large/Qtum_Logo_blue_CG.png?1696501874"}}}, {"description": "Janus is ready - Potential of Qtum's Janus\n\nQtum just released one of its most important implementations – Janus. Janus is a wrapper that allows developers to access an Ethereum-compatible environment on Qtum. The Janus wrapper will empower developers to easily port these apps over to Qtum and benefit significantly from reduced gas fees.\n\nThe Qtum team is now pleased to announce that Janus is now completely ready for deployment!! 🙌 🥳\n\n\n", "category": "milestone", "created_at": "2022-10-28T15:05:28.450Z", "user": null, "user_title": "Marketing Director", "pin": false, "project": {"type": "Coin", "id": "qtum", "name": "Qtum", "symbol": "qtum", "image": {"thumb": "https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/684/thumb/Qtum_Logo_blue_CG.png?1696501874", "small": "https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/684/small/Qtum_Logo_blue_CG.png?1696501874", "large": "https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/684/large/Qtum_Logo_blue_CG.png?1696501874"}}}, {"description": "Qtum Successfully Combines Taproot With EVM\n\nAs Qtum combines Bitcoin’s security with Ethereum’s programmability in one platform, one of the most exciting aspects of Qtum is that users can enjoy both Bitcoin and Ethereum updates. \n\nRead full post here:\nhttps://blog.qtum.org/qtum-successfully-combines-taproot-with-evm-46e2dd01d4dc", "category": "milestone", "created_at": "2022-09-08T14:38:00.964Z", "user": null, "user_title": "Marketing Director", "pin": false, "project": {"type": "Coin", "id": "qtum", "name": "Qtum", "symbol": "qtum", "image": {"thumb": "https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/684/thumb/Qtum_Logo_blue_CG.png?1696501874", "small": "https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/684/small/Qtum_Logo_blue_CG.png?1696501874", "large": "https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/684/large/Qtum_Logo_blue_CG.png?1696501874"}}}, {"description": "Upcoming Hardfork!\n\nMandatory update of Qtum Core wallets for the hard fork on July 31st, all users of the Qtum Core Wallet should update to version 22.1 as soon as possible.\n\nThe Qtum Mainnet hard fork will take place at block 2,080,512, approximately 8:40 pm GMT on July 31st (which may be on August 1st, depending on your time zone). The precise block height can me observed at https://qtum.info/\n\nRead full post here:\nhttps://medium.com/qtum/10-days-until-the-qtum-hard-fork-ecb15e6690c2", "category": "milestone", "created_at": "2022-07-25T17:00:59.438Z", "user": null, "user_title": "Marketing Director", "pin": false, "project": {"type": "Coin", "id": "qtum", "name": "Qtum", "symbol": "qtum", "image": {"thumb": "https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/684/thumb/Qtum_Logo_blue_CG.png?1696501874", "small": "https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/684/small/Qtum_Logo_blue_CG.png?1696501874", "large": "https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/684/large/Qtum_Logo_blue_CG.png?1696501874"}}}, {"description": "Join the Qtum Party RIGHT NOW in the GeckoCon 22 Metaverse! \n\nComment on this post for an exclusive ticket!\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:6953325436395286528\n\nQTUM x GeckoCon 22\n\n", "category": "general", "created_at": "2022-07-14T13:19:31.706Z", "user": null, "user_title": "Marketing Director", "pin": false, "project": {"type": "Coin", "id": "qtum", "name": "Qtum", "symbol": "qtum", "image": {"thumb": "https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/684/thumb/Qtum_Logo_blue_CG.png?1696501874", "small": "https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/684/small/Qtum_Logo_blue_CG.png?1696501874", "large": "https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/684/large/Qtum_Logo_blue_CG.png?1696501874"}}}, {"description": "Qtum’s June was super hectic as we attended Consensus 2022 as well as got ready for one of the most significant hard forks to date.\n\nOther highlights include:\n\n- June staking results\n- Web3athon — 3-month Qtum virtual hackathon with Coindesk \n- Taproot is on the way\n\nRead more about the community and development updates here:\n\nhttps://blog.qtum.org/june-community-development-updates-454e8a5ebf95", "category": "milestone", "created_at": "2022-07-07T12:39:03.552Z", "user": null, "user_title": "Marketing Director", "pin": false, "project": {"type": "Coin", "id": "qtum", "name": "Qtum", "symbol": "qtum", "image": {"thumb": "https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/684/thumb/Qtum_Logo_blue_CG.png?1696501874", "small": "https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/684/small/Qtum_Logo_blue_CG.png?1696501874", "large": "https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/684/large/Qtum_Logo_blue_CG.png?1696501874"}}}, {"description": "Qtum March Community &amp; Development Updates\n\nQtum had an eventful March, read more about Binance Blockchain Week in Dubai, topic contests, meme-contests and more!👇\n\nhttps://blog.qtum.org/march-community-development-updates-7c68367c3d27\nDon't forget to 👏 !\n", "category": "general", "created_at": "2022-04-05T11:22:47.614Z", "user": null, "user_title": "Marketing Director", "pin": false, "project": {"type": "Coin", "id": "qtum", "name": "Qtum", "symbol": "qtum", "image": {"thumb": "https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/684/thumb/Qtum_Logo_blue_CG.png?169650